VALUES (NULL, NULL, 8116, 'NaissanceE', 'NaissanceE', 'game', 2014, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cq0.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar2136.jpg', 'NaissanceE is a first-person adventure game in which you play Lucy, a lone roamer who finds herself trapped inside an enormous, surreal architectural structure. The environment is built around large-scale geometric spaces with shifting architecture, and you must navigate its corridors through platforming, environmental puzzles, and light-and-shadow mechanics that alter what is visible and accessible. The game offers no dialogue, cutscenes, or explicit guidance; progression relies entirely on spatial interpretation and exploration of the atemporal world. It follows a broadly linear path punctuated by more open areas to investigate, encouraging you to find your own way through each evolving space. The overall design emphasizes solitude, atmosphere, and self-directed discovery over narrative exposition.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/naissancee', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)"]', NULL, 5.9, 0, 9.51, '2026-11-23 03:29:46', '2026-11-23 03:29:46')
