VALUES (NULL, NULL, 152250, 'Stranger of Paradise: Final Fantasy Origin', 'Stranger of Paradise: Final Fantasy Origin', 'game', 2022, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cobp48.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar58k6.jpg', 'Jack and his allies, Ash and Jed, burn with resolve to defeat Chaos as they throw open the gates to the Chaos Shrine. Yet doubts remain—are they truly the Warriors of Light the prophecy foretold?
Step into a world of dark fantasy and revel in the exhilarating, action-packed battles!', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/stranger-of-paradise-final-fantasy-origin', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 7.3, 0, 6.025, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-23 03:29:46')
